flowchart LR
    A[Browser Client] -->|1. Request Portrait| B(API Gateway REST)
    B -->|2. HTTP POST| C[Monolithic Lambda]
    C -->|3. Save Webcam Snaps| D[(S3 Photos Bucket)]
    C -->|4. Push Task Payload| E[Amazon SQS Queue]
    E -->|5. Trigger Event| F[Lambda Worker]
    F -->|6. Detect Face & Crop| G[Amazon Rekognition]
    F -->|7. Composite Image| H[Pillow Library]
    F -->|8. Style Fusion| I[Bedrock Nova Canvas]
    I -->|9. Output Enhanced Scroll| D
    F -->|10. Update Status| J[(DynamoDB Sessions)]

